{"ID":"20240118151120-bkb96s9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151120-bkb96s9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151120-bkb96s9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151120-ybd47k3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122132515-lseq0cy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122132515-lseq0cy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:373,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:373\u0026#125;","title":"206竹叶","type":"doc","updated":"20240201135240"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151120-ybd47k3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151120-ybd47k3","updated":"20240122132442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，无毒。治咳逆上气，溢筋急，恶疡，杀小虫。根，作汤，益气，止渴，补虚，下气。汁，治风痉。实，通神明，轻身，益气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132446-zeerckv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132446-zeerckv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】为暖地山中之常绿苞木。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132447-9weld1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132447-9weld1u"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛平，性寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132448-bqo4ngg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132448-bqo4ngg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】竹叶为解热，祛痰，止渴，镇静药，止消喝，热狂烦闷及小儿警痫。压丹石毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132453-dty712y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132453-dty712y"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】治胸中痰热，咳逆上气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132456-vqp6m9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132456-vqp6m9i"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治吐血，热毒风，止消渴，压丹石毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132457-vfpyqf2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132457-vfpyqf2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】消痰，治狂热烦闷，中风失音不语，壮热，头风，头痛，止惊悸，温痔烦闷，妊妇头旋倒地，小儿惊痫天吊。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132459-lciji60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132459-lciji60"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】因叶在四旁，则主四散，故能清肌中之热，竹茹象人之筋脉，则清脉络之热以和血，秉天水之寒气，故治一切热。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132501-wl5p0g4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132501-wl5p0g4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】五钱至一两。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132503-4itveip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132503-4itveip"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】寒症忌用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122132503-qm2hl2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132503-qm2hl2y"}},{"ID":"20240122132504-zgte2uu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132504-zgte2uu"}},{"ID":"20240122132504-0z38in8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132504-0z38in8"}},{"ID":"20240122132504-k3pqcil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132504-k3pqcil","updated":"20240201135101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"206，竹叶，竹叶一样入经方。老师，什么竹叶？竹子的叶子啊？就是竹子的叶子。你拿来洗干净自己晒晒也可以，没有关系。当然你把它整理好了，绑起来就是这样子啊。那既然要入药，总是要做点功嘛让你看看。好象只有我的竹叶可以吃，你的竹叶不能吃，实际上都一样，只要你确定没有农药，没有乱洒农药的，确定它洗得干干净净的，晒干的，都可以。那就是竹叶。竹叶呢，当然你是用，你用3钱啊，2钱3钱，5钱都没有关系。竹叶我们在治疗，治病用得很多，你看它的性味，辛平，性寒。它是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"解热，祛痰，止渴，镇静，治疗消渴。临床上用得最多就是消渴，就是所谓的糖尿病。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"嘴巴口渴，我们开竹叶汤啊。张仲景在妇科里面也会用到竹叶来解热，能够袪痰。那这个竹叶呢，它专门去热，因为它是性寒的药，专门去这个痰热。尤其是痰热，妇女怀孕中间的热，这个竹叶非常的好用。消渴，口渴很重，那我最喜欢用的是，竹叶，3钱，老师那个天花粉不是很好？对呀，栝楼根呀，天花粉5钱，这个津液要把它升上来，老师，葛根可以升津液，他气没有上来，水上来，气还是不够，人精神还是不好，那用升麻，诸如此类的，处方加减就是这样出来拉。"}]},{"ID":"20240122132515-lseq0cy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122132515-lseq0cy","updated":"20240201135240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那【唐容川】说，竹叶呢，因为叶是往四面伸开来的，它是主四散。所以它能够消散肌肉里面的热。那竹茹呢，象人的经脉，药房拿来的时候哦，这边，等下我们找找看有没有。它捆起来的一个圆圈圈啊，好象一个足球一样。竹茹跟我们吃的竹笋不一样哈，那不要把竹笋拿来哦，不一样。它能够清络脉的热，来和血，让血不会那么热。所以竹叶呢，治一切的热，凡是热症，通通可以选用竹叶。既然竹叶是寒凉的药，那你寒症，病人寒症，已经很寒了你还在开竹叶，寒上加寒，不好，尽量不要用。在寒的药，光是寒的药，我们就分好几种不同类型的寒，竹叶是一种寒药，那跟黄连，黄芩，也是寒药，不一样的性质，如果我们没有讲绝对处方，经方的话，很不容易区分。讲处方的时候就分开来了。哇，老师，这个是寒凉，这个是寒凉，你看张仲景在这就选黄芩黄连不选用竹叶，在妇科里选用竹叶不选用黄芩黄连，都有他的意义在里面。"}]}]}